	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Mitto tibi, colendissime domine compater, hic literas (d. <persName ref="p8033">Bezae</persName>), <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quibus sine dubio exponit tibi profectionem suam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ad principes, et quid <placeName ref="l569">Wormatię</placeName> atque alibi... <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Idem enim nobis quoque per literas exposuit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Urget valde, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ut consentiamus in colloquium ut nostris hoc per<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>suadeamus hominibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Mittit simul aliam <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>confessionem <placeName ref="l569">Wormatiae</placeName> ab ipsis theologis illic con<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>gregatis exhibitam, quae mihi non placet.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">mallem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nos exhibuisse priorem illam apud <placeName ref="l2477">Palatinum</placeName> relictam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Vides, ut se torqueant et totis locutionibus Lutheranis <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quodammodo satisfacere moliantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Itaque metuo <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>mihi ab illis, si quando res ad collationem venire deberet.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Praevideo enim fore, ut ex luce nos in caliginem <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>aliquam inducturi sint, unde vix postea emergere <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>possimus.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Itaque rogo, ut mox mihi iudicium <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>tuum super hac illorum confessione et toto eorum instituto com<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>munices, ut apud nos quoque, quod commodum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>videbitur, agere possim.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>De <placeName ref="l167">Genevatibus</placeName> scripsi proxime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Ire legaten habend das <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>burgrecht angnon für sich selb, die doch vollmechtigen <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>gwallt, doch wellind sich hinder sich bringen.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Man <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>wartet nur ir bottschafft, die hie schwere; so wirt <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>man dann zuͦ inen ouch bottschafft schicken, die es den <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>schweere.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/><foreign xml:lang="la">Dum haec aguntur,</foreign> so kumpt der graff von Tschalon <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>und noch ein anderer mitt imm, <foreign xml:lang="la">missi a duce <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudię</placeName>.</foreign></s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Der begärt das burgrecht mitt m(inen) h(erren) <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>zuͦ ernüweren.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Ist also ein praetext; er mo <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>gern mitt m(inen) h(erren) umb das land.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Ettlich meinen, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>er hinderte gern das burgrecht mitt <placeName ref="l167">Genff</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Ab(er je) <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>me er handlet, je me <placeName ref="l41">B(ern)</placeName> und <placeName ref="l167">Genff</placeName> zemmen s... <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>werdend.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Inen wirt kurtzen bscheid hie werden.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>De <persName ref="p21430">Ioanne Göldlio iuniore</persName> hoc testari possum (ut <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>enim apud te hoc facerem, frater meus rogavit) <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>illum satis habere ingenii, si satis haberet diligentiae.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Annum hic egit integrum, honeste se gessit, quod vi<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>tam et mores atiinet, in studiis desideravi aliquam <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>diligentiam.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Nunc <placeName ref="l280">Lausannae</placeName> est, ubi illum magis <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>quam hic proficere posse spero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Haec festinanter <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>admodum; boni ergo consulas, si quid negligentius <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>scriptum fuerit.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> ultima novembris 1557.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Salutant te <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> et nostri omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem tu dic <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>vestris omnibus nostro nomine.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">I[ohannes] <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>H[allerus</persName>] tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>pastori fidelissimo, domino et comp<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>atri colendissimo charissimoque suo.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>M. <persName ref="p495">Heinrych Bullingern</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>zuͦ <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
